# Keep the build context small and never copy a host node_modules/.next over the baked ones.
template/node_modules
# The seed workspace verifies and renders the template's reference file and the image's install
# command, and is never copied into the image (no COPY names it). Excluding it keeps its own installed node_modules — tens of megabytes —
# out of the build context that the Windows VM uploads to ACR on every `az acr build`.
seed
template/.next
template/out
**/*.log
.git
